u-qwen-image), and place them in the `models/diffusion_models` directory.\n\n- **50-series GPUs:** use the **FP4** models  \n- **Other GPUs:** use the **INT4** models  \n\nNote: \n- `r128` models provide higher quality than `r32`, but run slightly slower. \n- LoRA support is not available now but will come soon.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [387.47528076171875, 145.53501892089844], "pos": [537.52197265625, 46.953712463378906], "id": 14, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["如果你得到太多模糊/黑暗/糟糕的图像, 请增加偏移量.如果你想要尝试增加细节, 请减少偏移量."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [261.87744140625, 102.99000549316406], "pos": [996.4202270507812, 57.97700119018555], "id": 10, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["将 cfg 设置为 1.0 以获得速度提升,.像 res_multistep 这样的采样器在 cfg 1.0 下表现相当不错.\n\n官方建议的步数是 50, 但即使只有 10 步似乎也能很好地工作."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [258.39337158203125, 138.69021606445312], "pos": [1297.227783203125, 61.44405746459961], "id": 11, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [13], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [329.8245849609375, 486], "pos": [1607.346923828125, 108.14923095703125], "widgets_values": [243377082384064, "randomize", 10, 1, "euler", "simple", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 19, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "pos